High-Pi/localization scaling leak certificate.  This is not a global NS
solution constructor; it records the exact analytic obstruction exposed by the
pencil/PDE workbench pass: if a finite-energy localization regime bounds all
cutoff, Leray, pressure-tail, and no-reuse invoices by a fixed fraction of the
