/--
Same-owner Pi-lock budget bridge.  This is the Level412 source contract for the
Level411 numeric gap field: the free pi-group is pinned by the active-scale
Reynolds law, and the resulting cutoff invoice is bounded by the same selected
owner-root budget.  The same-jet equalities are source equalities, not
post-payoff definitions.
-/
structure SameOwnerPiLockBudgetBridge where
  liftedJet : LocalAffineTraceZeroPositiveStretchingJet
  piLock : ParabolicActiveScalePiLockForCutoffPayment
  ownerRootBudgetForGap : Real
  totalInvoice_le_ownerRootBudget : piLock.totalInvoice <= ownerRootBudgetForGap
  sameEtaAsPiLock : liftedJet.eta = piLock.localJet.eta
  sameAAsPiLock : liftedJet.A = piLock.localJet.A
