/--
Correlated high-low coarea/interface slice source.  This is the honest positive
repair of the low-slice obstruction: the selected threshold is not merely cheap
for boundary cost; it is certified to lie in a high-interface/overlap slice on
the same owner-root event before payoff.
-/
