LEI-native high-interface prefix: instead of transferring an external H-prefix
onto the suitable-local-energy carrier, the H events are declared as the fixed
event tents of the suitable-defect source.  This pays the event-family binding
by construction; the remaining PDE input is an active-floor lower bound on one
selected LEI event.
-/
