Level311 injection target: the only remaining way to retype the original
exception debit is an explicit pre-payoff map from each exception-debit atom to
a same-carrier heat-square collar atom with pointwise debit domination and
bounded multiplicity.
-/
structure PressureExceptionToHeatCollarInjectionSource (Ω : Type u) where
  retypingSource : AnalyticCollarExceptionDebitRetypingSource Ω
  exceptionAtomDebit : ℕ → ℝ
  heatCollarAtomMass : ℕ → ℝ
