/--
Non-laundering bridge for the reinterpretation step.

The annular `L1` multiplier lemma may be consumed only when the selected
projected target has first been identified with the already-selected
nonadaptive annular event stream.  The fresh charge below is therefore the
prior event stream itself, and the prefix bound must come from the upstream
owner-preimage receipt, not from the realized projected output.
